    "Windows": {},
    "Windows of these apps can't be pinned. Partial names match too: “Note” excludes Notes and Notefile.": {},
    "With one file selected in Finder, ← and → move through the other items of its folder. With several selected, Peek moves between those.": {},
    "Without $PATH this replaces the PATH zsh and apps inherit; add $PATH to keep the system folders.": {},
    "Without this the displays may still turn off while the Mac stays awake.": {},
    "Works in zsh, macOS's default shell. The handler only prints suggestions when output goes to a terminal, so scripts see zsh's normal error. Uninstall removes the block; nothing else in .zshrc is touched, and a backup is kept from before the first change.": {},
